    "updated_at": "2024-11-22T09:38:27Z",
    "body": "Nice, the HTML find is legit and would also need to be updated I suspect. It would benefit from having the obtaining defined in File API so there's less need for duplication. Reporting API seems bogus: https://github.com/w3c/reporting/issues/273. Web Authentication API seems similarly bogus: https://github.com/w3c/webauthn/issues/2212.",
