    "updated_at": "2024-11-25T05:18:28Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the feedback, I've updated my FileAPI PR [1] to expose an obtain algorithm as recommended here, and I've updated this PR to use it. One question I thought more about was what to do when the request doesn't have an associated environment... It seems like for Blob URLs we should allow navigations to bypass the partitioning checks, but otherwise we should just fail (this seems in line with the Chromium implementation at least). WDYT?\r\n\r\n[1] https://github.com/w3c/FileAPI/pull/201/files",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
